{
  "program": "CBACT01C",
  "caseId": "case03",
  "description": "One record - the first of the shipped fixture - with every one of the thirteen CVACT01Y spans pinned by name as well as by the complete 300-byte image. This is the case that fixes the field-for-field contract: ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE is pinned under the misspelling app/cpy/CVACT01Y.cpy:L11 actually carries, and FILLER PIC X(178) at L17 is pinned as an addressable span of 178 spaces rather than treated as a gap. The record's total width is what proves FILLER was emitted at all, since a record missing it would be short by exactly 178 bytes. ACCT-CURR-BAL is stated as the stored image 00000001940{, whose trailing '{' is a positive-zero overpunch and which denotes 194.00 in a twelve-character S9(10)V99 span.",
